  "system": {
    "description": {
      "gm": "",
      "value": "<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">As if the moon and the stars had been guiding you the whole time, you always know how to find safety and sustenance. You can Subsist using Nature or Medicine and gain the Forager feat, even if you don’t meet its prerequisites, and you get its benefits even if you use another skill to Subsist. When you Subsist, a creature you feed also gains a +2 circumstance bonus your next attempt to Treat Wounds or their next saving throw against a poison or disease.</span></p>"
